[ENABLE]
disableMemrec(memrec)
showText([[
1.) Open the param you want to view from the list

2.) Click the "Get Address" section for that param

3.) Either use the dropdown to select what you want to view or input the id

4.) Click run to populate the address field in

5.) Click "Open" and view the specific param

Note: Table paramdefs may be incomplete. If you suspect or confirm what a value is
feel free to let us know in the grand cathedral discord.
]])

[DISABLE]
</AssemblerScript>
